2026-11-19 round (verification, compatibility, performance):

- Added `tests/corpus/` (29 programs) and `tests/compare.sh`: 29/29 match the
  Node/Bun oracle after the console-format fix.
- `engine -` now reads stdin; regression test in `cli/tests/commands.rs`.
- Added a Node-shaped inspector (`crates/compat/src/inspect.rs`) for console
  output: compact objects/arrays, single-quoted strings, Map/Set, numeric keys,
  circular markers. Boa's inspector previously printed multi-line objects and
  `Array(2)` for nested arrays.
- Optimiser verifies only the changed function (`ir::verify_function`) instead
  of the whole module after every pass, and removes functions unreachable from
  the entry with call remapping. On the 5,007-line component benchmark total
  JIT compile time fell from 1327 ms to 6.9 ms with identical output.
